1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,040
GTA tarixi: oddiy o‘yindan
milliard dollarlik imperiyagacha.

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:08,570
GTA 6 nimasi bilan
dunyoni hayratga solmoqda?

3
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:11,880
Tasavvur qiling, 1997-yil.

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:15,620
Kompyuter ekranida yuqoridan
ko‘rinadigan oddiy bir o‘yin.

5
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:20,180
Kichkina mashinalar, sodda grafikalar va
ko‘chalarda harakatlanayotgan odamlar.

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,951
O‘sha paytda bu o‘yinni yaratgan
dasturchilar kelajakda u butun dunyo o‘yin

7
00:00:24,971 --> 00:00:28,340
sanoatini o‘zgartirib yuborishini
tasavvur ham qilmagan bo‘lishi mumkin.

8
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:31,020
Oradan qariyb 30 yil o‘tdi.

9
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:33,920
Endi esa butun dunyo
bitta o‘yinni kutmoqda.

10
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,990
Grand Theft Auto 6.

11
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:39,190
Yoki hammamiz biladigan nom bilan: GTA 6.

12
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:41,840
Bu shunchaki kompyuter o‘yini emas.

13
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:46,500
Bu milliardlab dollar daromad keltirgan,
butun bir avlodning bolaligiga aylangan

14
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:50,640
va har bir yangi qismi bilan
rekordlar o‘rnatgan ulkan franshiza.

15
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:54,000
Lekin siz GTA aslida qanday
yaratilganini bilasizmi?

16
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:57,200
Nega bu o‘yin dastlab deyarli
muvaffaqiyatsizlikka uchragan?

17
00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:00,920
Nima uchun GTA San Andreas shu
qadar mashhur bo‘lib ketgan?

18
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:05,140
GTA 5 qanday qilib tarixdagi eng
katta ko‘ngilochar loyihalardan biriga

19
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:05,680
aylangan?

20
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:09,470
Va eng muhimi, GTA 6 nima
uchun shuncha yil kuttirdi?

21
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:14,723
Bugun biz GTA o‘yinining ilk
yaratilishidan to GTA 6 davrigacha bo‘lgan

22
00:01:14,743 --> 00:01:15,940
tarixini ko‘rib chiqamiz.

23
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:20,960
Bu tarixda tasodifiy kashfiyotlar,
ulkan tavakkalchiliklar, milliardlab

24
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:24,200
dollarlar va butun dunyoni
hayratga solgan qarorlar bor.

25
00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:28,510
Hammasi esa Shotlandiyadagi kichik
bir o‘yin studiyasidan boshlangan.

26
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:31,450
1990-yillarning o‘rtalari.

27
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:33,240
Shotlandiyaning Dandi shahri.

28
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:37,820
DMA Design nomli kompaniyada dasturchilar
yangi o‘yin ustida ishlayotgan edi.

29
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:42,740
Ularning maqsadi katta, ochiq shaharda
avtomobillar harakatlanadigan, politsiya

30
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:45,240
jinoyatchilarni ta’qib
qiladigan o‘yin yaratish edi.

31
00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:48,140
Dastlab loyiha Race’n’Chase deb nomlangan.

32
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:51,130
Ammo ishlab chiqish jarayonida
qiziq holat yuz berdi.

33
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:55,519
Politsiya avtomobillarining harakati bilan
bog‘liq texnik muammolar tufayli ular

34
00:01:55,539 --> 00:01:58,640
o‘yinchini haddan tashqari
agressiv ta’qib qila boshlagan.

35
00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:02,550
Bu kutilmagan holat o‘yinni
yanada qiziqarli qilgan.

36
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,100
Dasturchilar shuni angladi: odamlar oddiy
poygadan ko‘ra politsiyadan qochish va

37
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:11,580
shahar ichida erkin harakatlanishni
ko‘proq yoqtirishi mumkin.

38
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:14,050
Shu tariqa o‘yinning g‘oyasi o‘zgardi.

39
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:19,420
1997-yilda Grand Theft Auto
nomli birinchi o‘yin chiqarildi.

40
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:23,941
O‘yinchi mashina o‘g‘irlashi, topshiriqlar
bajarishi va katta shahar bo‘ylab

41
00:02:23,961 --> 00:02:25,190
harakatlanishi mumkin edi.

42
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:29,060
Bugungi GTA bilan solishtirganda
uning grafikasi juda oddiy ko‘rinadi.

43
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:33,820
Lekin o‘sha davr uchun bitta g‘oya
nihoyatda kuchli edi: o‘yinchi faqat

44
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,820
belgilangan yo‘ldan
yurishga majbur emasdi.

45
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,340
U o‘z yo‘lini o‘zi tanlashi mumkin edi.

46
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:43,420
Va aynan mana shu erkinlik keyinchalik
GTA’ning eng muhim xususiyatiga aylandi.

47
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:48,465
Ammo bu hali boshlanish edi, chunki
haqiqiy inqilob 2001-yilda yuz

48
00:02:48,485 --> 00:02:48,970
berdi.

49
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:50,640
2001-yil.

50
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:53,480
GTA III dunyoga taqdim etildi.

51
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:55,500
Bu safar o‘yin butunlay o‘zgargan edi.

52
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:59,650
Endi shahar yuqoridan emas, uch
o‘lchamli ko‘rinishda namoyon bo‘lardi.

53
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:04,083
O‘yinchi ko‘chalarda yurishi, mashina
haydashi, topshiriqlar bajarishi va

54
00:03:04,103 --> 00:03:06,210
istagan tomoniga
harakatlanishi mumkin edi.

55
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:10,580
Liberty City nomli xayoliy shahar
Nyu-Yorkdan ilhomlanib yaratilgan.

56
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:14,510
O‘sha davr uchun bunday
erkinlik nihoyatda yangilik edi.

57
00:03:14,660 --> 00:03:19,080
GTA III ochiq dunyoli o‘yinlar
rivojiga ulkan ta’sir ko‘rsatdi.

58
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:22,720
Va bu muvaffaqiyatdan keyin
Rockstar Games to‘xtab qolmadi.

59
00:03:22,740 --> 00:03:24,180
2002-yil.

60
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:26,590
GTA Vice City chiqarildi.

61
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:31,940
Bu safar voqealar 1980-yillar Miami
shahridan ilhomlangan Vice City’da

62
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:32,520
kechardi.

63
00:03:32,540 --> 00:03:37,580
Neon chiroqlar, sport avtomobillari,
plyajlar, musiqa va jinoyat

64
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,090
olami.

65
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:40,700
Bosh qahramon Tommy Vercetti edi.

66
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:45,046
U oddiy topshiriqlarni bajarishdan
boshlaydi va asta-sekin shaharning jinoyat

67
00:03:45,066 --> 00:03:46,820
olamida kuchli shaxsga aylanadi.

68
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:50,920
Vice City’ning eng katta
yutuqlaridan biri uning atmosferasi.

69
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:56,100
O‘yin shunchaki topshiriqlar
to‘plami emas, go‘yoki 1980-yillar

70
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,020
haqidagi jinoyat filmiga o‘xshardi.

71
00:03:58,040 --> 00:04:03,080
Lekin GTA tarixidagi eng esda qolarli
davrlardan biri hali oldinda edi.

72
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:04,660
2004-yil.

73
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:07,310
Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas.

74
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:10,900
Bu nomni eshitgan ko‘plab
insonlar bolaligini eslaydi.

75
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:15,980
Kompyuter klublari, do‘stlar bilan
o‘ynash, mashinalar, politsiya va

76
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,140
mashhur kodlar.

77
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:20,510
Eng muhimi esa CJ, Carl Johnson.

78
00:04:20,940 --> 00:04:25,320
San Andreas o‘yinida CJ onasining
o‘limidan keyin Los Santosga qaytadi.

79
00:04:25,340 --> 00:04:30,220
U eski do‘stlari, oilasi va ko‘cha
guruhlari o‘rtasidagi mojarolarga aralashib

80
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:30,740
qoladi.

81
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:34,780
Lekin bu o‘yinning mashhur bo‘lishiga
faqat hikoya sabab bo‘lmagan.

82
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:40,110
San Andreas avvalgi qismlarga qaraganda
ancha katta imkoniyatlarni taqdim etdi.

83
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:44,920
O‘yinchi sport zaliga borishi, ovqatlanishi,
kiyimlarini almashtirishi, soch

84
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:49,360
turmagini o‘zgartirishi, avtomobillarini
sozlashi va uchta katta shahar bo‘ylab

85
00:04:49,380 --> 00:04:50,820
sayohat qilishi mumkin edi.

86
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:54,360
Los Santos, San Fierro, Las Venturas.

87
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:59,730
Bundan tashqari qishloqlar, tog‘lar,
cho‘llar va aeroportlar ham mavjud edi.

88
00:04:59,780 --> 00:05:05,140
San Andreas shunchaki o‘yin emas,
o‘ziga xos virtual hayotga aylangandi.

89
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:09,940
Hatto bugun ham ko‘plab o‘yinchilar uni
GTA tarixidagi eng sevimli qismlardan

90
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:11,210
biri deb hisoblaydi.

91
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:14,010
Ammo texnologiyalar
rivojlanishda davom etdi.

92
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:16,840
2008-yilda GTA IV chiqarildi.

93
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:20,650
Bu safar bosh qahramon Niko
Bellic ismli muhojir edi.

94
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:23,140
U Amerikaga yangi hayot izlab keladi.

95
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:27,653
Ammo orzu qilgan hayoti bilan haqiqiy
hayot o‘rtasida katta farq borligini

96
00:05:27,673 --> 00:05:28,270
anglaydi.

97
00:05:28,460 --> 00:05:33,810
GTA IV avvalgi qismlarga qaraganda
jiddiyroq va dramatikroq hikoyaga ega edi.

98
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:38,480
Avtomobillarning harakati, odamlarning
reaksiyasi va o‘yindagi fizika tizimi

99
00:05:38,500 --> 00:05:40,510
sezilarli darajada rivojlandi.

100
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:45,420
Rockstar Games endi shunchaki katta xarita
yaratishni emas, balki o‘sha xaritani

101
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:47,760
yanada ishonarliroq
qilishni maqsad qilgan edi.

102
00:05:47,780 --> 00:05:51,420
Va nihoyat 2013-yil keldi.

103
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,640
GTA 5.

104
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:56,000
Bu o‘yin butun sanoatni larzaga soldi.

105
00:05:56,020 --> 00:06:01,350
Chunki unda bitta emas, uchta bosh
qahramon mavjud edi: Michael, Franklin,

106
00:06:01,380 --> 00:06:02,130
Trevor.

107
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:06,560
Ularning har biri o‘z xarakteri,
muammolari va maqsadlariga ega edi.

108
00:06:06,580 --> 00:06:10,920
O‘yinchi ular o‘rtasida almashib,
voqealarni turli nuqtayi nazardan kuzatishi

109
00:06:10,940 --> 00:06:11,540
mumkin edi.

110
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:16,080
Los Santos shahri esa avvalgidan ham
kattaroq va batafsilroq ko‘rinishga ega

111
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:16,630
bo‘ldi.

112
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:18,010
Tog‘lar, okean,

113
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:22,280
aeroportlar, shahar markazi,
cho‘llar va turli faoliyat turlari.

114
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:27,480
Ammo GTA 5’ning eng katta yutuqlaridan
biri uning moliyaviy muvaffaqiyati edi.

115
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:31,880
O‘yin chiqarilgan dastlabki uch kun
ichida bir milliard dollarlik savdo

116
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:32,860
ko‘rsatkichiga erishdi.

117
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:37,420
Bu ko‘ngilochar sanoat tarixidagi eng tez
milliard dollarlik savdo natijalaridan

118
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:38,040
biri edi.

119
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:39,110
2026-yil

120
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:44,460
noyabriga kelib esa GTA 5’ning sotilgan
nusxalari soni 230 milliondan oshgan

121
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:44,660
edi.

122
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:49,520
Bir o‘ylab ko‘ring: 2013-yilda
chiqarilgan o‘yin o‘n yildan ko‘proq vaqt

123
00:06:49,540 --> 00:06:52,580
davomida dunyoning eng mashhur
o‘yinlari qatorida qoldi.

124
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:55,580
Bunga GTA Online ham katta hissa qo‘shdi.

125
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:59,440
O‘yinchilar internet orqali bitta
dunyoga kirib, birgalikda topshiriqlar

126
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:04,080
bajarish, avtomobillar xarid qilish,
biznes yuritish va musobaqalarda qatnashish

127
00:07:04,100 --> 00:07:05,310
imkoniyatiga ega bo‘ldi.

128
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:09,560
Rockstar esa yangi yangilanishlar orqali
o‘yinchilarni uzoq yillar davomida

129
00:07:09,580 --> 00:07:10,360
ushlab turdi.

130
00:07:10,380 --> 00:07:15,460
Lekin shu vaqt ichida muxlislarning
bitta savoli bor edi: GTA 6 qachon

131
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,030
chiqadi?

132
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:20,940
Yillar o‘tdi, yangi konsollar paydo
bo‘ldi, grafika, texnologiyalar rivojlandi.

133
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:25,330
Ammo GTA 6 haqida rasmiy ma’lumotlar
uzoq vaqt juda kam bo‘ldi.

134
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:29,500
2022-yilda esa Rockstar Games
katta kiber hujumga uchradi.

135
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:33,860
Internetga GTA 6’ning ishlab chiqilish
jarayoniga oid ko‘plab videolar tarqaldi.

136
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:37,780
Bu o‘yin sanoatidagi eng shov-shuvli
ma’lumot sizib chiqish hodisalaridan biri

137
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,180
bo‘ldi.

138
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:42,880
Muxlislar yangi shaharning ayrim
ko‘rinishlarini va bosh qahramonlarini ilk bor

139
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:44,520
norasmiy videolarda ko‘rishdi.

140
00:07:44,540 --> 00:07:49,720
Nihoyat, 2023-yil dekabr oyida GTA
6’ning birinchi rasmiy treyleri

141
00:07:49,740 --> 00:07:50,530
namoyish etildi.

142
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:52,730
Internet yana portladi.

143
00:07:52,980 --> 00:07:54,100
Vice City qaytdi.

144
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:57,480
Lekin bu endi 2002-yildagi
Vice City emas edi.

145
00:07:57,500 --> 00:08:03,070
Bu zamonaviy Amerika hayotidan
ilhomlangan, ijtimoiy tarmoqlar, plyajlar,

146
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:07,520
avtomobillar va rang-barang odamlar
bilan to‘ldirilgan yangi dunyo edi.

147
00:08:07,540 --> 00:08:11,880
Eng katta yangiliklardan biri:
Lucia ismli ayol bosh qahramon.

148
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:15,760
Uning yonida esa Jason ismli
ikkinchi bosh qahramon bor.

149
00:08:15,780 --> 00:08:20,260
Ularning munosabatlari va jinoyat
olamiga aralashib qolishi GTA 6’ning

150
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:21,660
g‘oyasining markazida turadi.

151
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:25,900
O‘yin AQShning Florida shtatidan
ilhomlangan Leonida nomli xayoliy hududda

152
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,070
bo‘lib o‘tadi.

153
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:32,480
Rockstar yangi o‘yinda katta ochiq dunyo,
batafsil muhit va zamonaviy jamiyat

154
00:08:32,500 --> 00:08:34,460
satirasini birlashtirishga harakat qilgan.

155
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:38,120
Ammo GTA 6’ning chiqarilish
sanasi bir necha marta o‘zgardi.

156
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:40,840
Dastlab 2025-yilga rejalashtirilgan edi.

157
00:08:40,860 --> 00:08:43,580
Keyin 2026-yil may oyiga ko‘chirildi.

158
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:48,700
So‘ng Rockstar Games 2026-yil
19-noyabrni yangi sana sifatida

159
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,500
e’lon qildi.

160
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:53,660
Va mana, 2026-yil
19-noyabr ham yetib keldi.

161
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:58,600
Rockstar Games’ning rasmiy sahifasida
GTA 6’ning chiqarilish treyleri, oldindan

162
00:08:58,620 --> 00:09:03,620
yuklash imkoniyati va PlayStation 5
hamda Xbox Series X va S platformalari

163
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,260
ko‘rsatilgan.

164
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:06,520
Lekin bu yerda yana bir savol tug‘iladi.

165
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:10,160
Nega GTA 6’ni yaratish uchun
shuncha vaqt kerak bo‘ldi?

166
00:09:10,180 --> 00:09:15,080
Sababi, zamonaviy GTA kabi o‘yinlarni
ishlab chiqish nihoyatda murakkab.

167
00:09:15,100 --> 00:09:17,070
Minglab obyektlar, avtomobillar

168
00:09:17,540 --> 00:09:22,460
harakati, sun’iy intellekt orqali
boshqariladigan odamlar, yoritish tizimlari,

169
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:27,480
ovoz yozish, animatsiyalar, shahar
dizayni, hikoya va topshiriqlar.

170
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:30,500
Bularning barchasi bir-biri
bilan ishlashi kerak.

171
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:33,640
Tasavvur qiling: o‘yinchi
avtomobil haydab ketmoqda.

172
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:38,550
Yo‘lda boshqa mashinalar harakatlanadi,
piyodalar yuradi, svetoforlar ishlaydi,

173
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:42,240
politsiya jinoyatlarga javob
qaytaradi, ob-havo o‘zgaradi.

174
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:45,820
Va bularning hammasi real
vaqtning o‘zida hisoblanadi.

175
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:50,300
Shu sababli katta ochiq dunyoli o‘yinlarni
yaratish ko‘p yillik mehnat talab

176
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:50,520
qiladi.

177
00:09:50,540 --> 00:09:55,680
GTA 6’ning umumiy xarajatlari haqida
internetda 1 milliard, yoki hatto 2

178
00:09:55,700 --> 00:09:57,760
milliard dollarlik raqamlar ham tarqalgan.

179
00:09:57,780 --> 00:10:02,120
Ammo bunday summalarni Rockstar rasman
tasdiqlagan aniq ishlab chiqarish

180
00:10:02,140 --> 00:10:04,160
byudjeti sifatida qabul
qilish to‘g‘ri emas.

181
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:09,176
Shunga qaramay GTA 6 o‘yin sanoatining
eng katta loyihalaridan biri

182
00:10:09,196 --> 00:10:10,290
ekani shubhasiz.

183
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:13,230
Endi GTA tarixiga yana bir bor qarang.

184
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:17,520
1997-yilda oddiy yuqoridan
ko‘rinadigan shahar.

185
00:10:17,540 --> 00:10:21,100
2001-yilda uch o‘lchamli Liberty City.

186
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:23,730
2002-yilda Vice City.

187
00:10:23,980 --> 00:10:26,150
2004-yilda San Andreas.

188
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:29,030
2008-yilda GTA IV.

189
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:31,850
2013-yilda GTA 5.

190
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:35,370
Va 2026-yilda GTA 6.

191
00:10:35,460 --> 00:10:40,900
Qariyb 30 yil ichida GTA kichik
tajribaviy loyihadan dunyoning eng mashhur

192
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,840
ko‘ngilochar brendlaridan biriga aylandi.

193
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:44,160
Buning siri nimada?

194
00:10:44,180 --> 00:10:45,760
Faqat grafikadami?

195
00:10:45,780 --> 00:10:47,880
Faqat mashinalar va qurollardami?

196
00:10:47,900 --> 00:10:48,660
Yo‘q.

197
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:53,560
GTA’ning eng katta muvaffaqiyati o‘yinchiga
erkinlik hissini bera olishidadir.

198
00:10:53,580 --> 00:10:56,020
Siz topshiriq bajarishingiz mumkin.

199
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:59,580
Yoki shunchaki mashina haydab
shaharni tomosha qilishingiz mumkin.

200
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:02,080
Siz hikoyani davom ettirishingiz mumkin.

201
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:04,980
Yoki o‘zingiz uchun yangi
sarguzasht topishingiz mumkin.

202
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:09,770
GTA’ni boshqa ko‘plab o‘yinlardan ajratib
turadigan jihatlardan biri ham shu.

203
00:11:09,860 --> 00:11:13,680
Ammo bu tarixning eng
hayratlanarli tomoni boshqa.

204
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:18,620
Bir paytlar oddiy texnik tajriba sifatida
boshlangan loyiha bugun milliardlab

205
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:21,880
dollar aylanadigan ulkan
sanoatning bir qismiga aylandi.

206
00:11:21,900 --> 00:11:26,160
Va bularning hammasi kichik bir
studiyadagi dasturchilarning g‘oyasidan

207
00:11:26,180 --> 00:11:26,900
boshlangan.

208
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,860
Endi sizga savol.

209
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:32,450
Sizningcha, GTA tarixidagi
eng zo‘r o‘yin qaysi?

210
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,490
GTA Vice City’mi?

211
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,210
GTA San Andreas’mi?

212
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:37,680
GTA 5’mi?

213
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:41,310
Yoki GTA 6 ularning
barchasidan o‘zib ketadimi?

214
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:43,430
Fikringizni izohlarda yozib qoldiring.

215
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:46,400
Chunki GTA tarixida yangi davr boshlandi.

216
00:11:46,420 --> 00:11:48,930
Va bu tarix hali tugagani yo‘q.

